// The provisioner's protocol: what `fileshare serve` may ask the privileged
// `fileshare provisioner` to do, and nothing else. See docs/volumes.md.
//
// It is spoken on a unix socket only, and the provisioner answers one uid --
// its configured client_uid, read from the socket with SO_PEERCRED -- with
// PERMISSION_DENIED for anybody else. The verbs are CLOSED: a method this file
