//	OUT_OF_RANGE         a quota above the configured max_volume
//	RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED   the parent has no room, or no project id is left
//	ALREADY_EXISTS       the name is taken with other parameters, or by something
//	                     the provisioner did not create
//	NOT_FOUND            resizing or snapshotting a volume that does not exist
//	FAILED_PRECONDITION  deleting a volume with snapshots or data without
//	                     destroy_data; shrinking below what is used; touching
//	                     something that carries no ownership mark
